{
    "title": "Wear OS Watch Neon Shatte",
    "description": "Install Wear OS\u2122 Powered by Samsung Watch Faces\r\nhttps://youtu.be/vMM4Q2-rqoM\r\n\r\nThe unique NeonShatter watch face for Wear OS (API level 28+) will make your everyday life brighter and more exciting. It offers a dynamic design that creates a shattering effect with a looping animation of shards on the background and bright neon highlights on their edges. This design catches the eye and allows your watch to stand out from the rest.\r\n\r\nThe main features of the watch face are a step counter, date, and heart rate, which are displayed on the screen. Three step bars, date, and heart rate help you keep track of your physical activity and health status.\r\n\r\nTo install this watch face, you need to have Wear OS with API level 28+ on your device. After that, it is easily customizable and can be added to the watch screen. Additionally, NeonShatter has a high degree of compatibility with most devices running Wear OS, making it accessible to all users.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn conclusion, NeonShatter is a colorful and functional watch face that brings extra comfort and visual pleasure to your life. Don't miss the opportunity to make your watch more interesting and individual - download NeonShatter right now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Install Wear OS\u2122 Powered by Samsung Watch Faces<br>https://youtu.be/vMM4Q2-rqoM<br><br>The unique NeonShatter watch face for Wear OS (API level 28+) will make your everyday life brighter and more exciting. It offers a dynamic design that creates a shattering effect with a looping animation of shards on the background and bright neon highlights on their edges. This design catches the eye and allows your watch to stand out from the rest.<br><br>The main features of the watch face are a step counter, date, and heart rate, which are displayed on the screen. Three step bars, date, and heart rate help you keep track of your physical activity and health status.<br><br>To install this watch face, you need to have Wear OS with API level 28+ on your device. After that, it is easily customizable and can be added to the watch screen. Additionally, NeonShatter has a high degree of compatibility with most devices running Wear OS, making it accessible to all users.<br><br><br>In conclusion, NeonShatter is a colorful and functional watch face that brings extra comfort and visual pleasure to your life. Don&#39;t miss the opportunity to make your watch more interesting and individual - download NeonShatter right now!",
